Using hints from [[Joan of Arc]]'s notes that they had retrieved in the [[Cave of the Gargoyle]], the [[Huntik Foundation]] team found the abandoned church by spotting it from the top of the [[Cathedral of Notre Dame]].

The church's bell tower had sunlight streaming down to the floor over the secret entrance into the [[Paris Catacombs]]. A series of mirrors would reflect sunlight at a certain angle to trigger the mechanism. [[Sophie Casterwill]] used these mirrors to reflect a [[Raypulse]] spell and opened the passage to the catacombs, while [[DeFoe]] and his [[Suits]] embushed the team. After the passage was opened, they retreated in the caverns by destroying the entrance. {{source|Crawling the Catacombs}}

